WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.695
Peter and Benjamin were in the farmer's field.

2
00:00:16.696 --> 00:00:21.247
"Tag!" Peter cried. "You're it!"

3
00:00:21.248 --> 00:00:23.972
Benjamin chased Peter.

4
00:00:23.973 --> 00:00:29.390
The lambs were in the yard with Kep.

5
00:00:29.391 --> 00:00:34.877
They watched the bunnies play tag.

6
00:00:34.878 --> 00:00:38.863
"We want to play too!" the lambs said.

7
00:00:38.864 --> 00:00:42.856
They hopped and skipped to the field.

8
00:00:42.857 --> 00:00:45.590
Kep barked at the lambs.

9
00:00:45.591 --> 00:00:48.574
"Where are you going?"

10
00:00:48.575 --> 00:00:52.967
"They want to play tag," Peter called.

11
00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:55.224
"No!" Kep said.

12
00:00:55.225 --> 00:00:57.467
"The lambs must stay in the yard.

13
00:00:57.468 --> 00:00:59.893
I must watch them."

14
00:00:59.894 --> 00:01:01.809
Benjamin frowned.

15
00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:05.345
"We can watch the lambs."

16
00:01:05.346 --> 00:01:07.640
Kep shook his head.

17
00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:09.525
"Play a game here.

18
00:01:09.526 --> 00:01:14.260
How about Ring Around the Rosy?"

19
00:01:14.261 --> 00:01:21.679
"Boring!" Peter said.

20
00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:37.308
Kep barked.

21
00:01:37.309 --> 00:01:43.312
He ran around the lambs.

22
00:01:43.313 --> 00:01:50.772
At last everyone was in the yard.

23
00:01:50.773 --> 00:01:53.231
"Whew!" Kep said.

24
00:01:53.232 --> 00:01:55.772
"I'm tired!"

25
00:01:55.773 --> 00:02:00.204
Kep lay down under a tree.

26
00:02:00.205 --> 00:02:06.383
Soon he fell asleep.

